@swill-ib I looked at your first three issues: #472, #473 and #476. All three follow the template, show what you ran and saw, say what you did not test, and changed no product code. #476 matches the current source: both helpers are stubs that only print "not yet connected" (`src/superclaude/cli/sprint/logging_.py` lines 367-378).

#472 and #473 are already fixed and merged in PR #475, and both issues are closed.

You can continue. Go on with the rest of Part 1, and start Part 2 and Part 3 as well; nothing else needs to wait. Same rules: one issue per real bug, one comment per measurement on #354, and no product fixes.
